<title>PHILIPPINES: Solidbank says Q3 net at 105.864 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Solidbank says Q3 net at 105.864 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>SolidBank Corp posted a net income of 105.864 million pesos in the third quarter of 1996, documents it submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Total operating income reached 1.147 billion pesos, while total operating expenses amounted to 999.937 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
